# Gateway runtime state (runtime_dir): revision store, gateway.db, vault,
# sessions, artifacts, logs. Was the hidden `agents/.gateway/`.
#
# Listed per-location rather than as a bare `runtime/` — that pattern would also
# swallow the `src/runtime/` source tree.
/runtime/
/autonoetic-gateway/runtime/
/autonoetic/runtime/
/examples/**/runtime/
**/.gateway/
